    "mechanicalProblem": {
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "options": [
        "(long long)a * b",
        "(long long)(a * b)",
        "1LL * a * b",
        "a * (long long)b"
      ],
      "answers": [
        "0",
        "2",
        "3"
      ],
      "explanation": "转换必须发生在有风险的乘法之前。A、C、D的乘法按long long进行；B先按int相乘，发生有符号溢出后再转换，不能挽救。",
